Read-only CPU validation of the final fresh side-PI v6 checkpoint. This entry
point reuses the existing baseline/checkpoint validator without changing its
8192-step expectations. It pins the trial protocol, source count, baseline
hash, and final expected step count for the 196608-step artifact.

